<title>USA: Dow surges on rally in high techs, bonds.</title>
<headline>Dow surges on rally in high techs, bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue chip stocks surged on Wednesday, boosted by strength in the high-technology sector and a recovery in bond prices.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 50 points to 8,238 at 11:14 a.m. EDT(/15:14 GMT), which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
